          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Filkollen": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Välkommen till Filkollen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What takes up space in your home folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vad som tar plats i din hemmapp"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What these are": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vad det här är"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When opened at login, Filkollen starts quietly in the menu bar with no window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "När Filkollen öppnas vid inloggning startar den tyst i menyraden utan fönster."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Xcode, simulator and package-manager caches": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cacheminnen för Xcode, simulatorer och pakethanterare"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS Backups & Firmware": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS-säkerhetskopior och firmware"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone and iPad backups and leftover update files": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Säkerhetskopior av iPhone och iPad och överblivna uppdateringsfiler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS needs you to allow Filkollen in Login Items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS behöver att du tillåter Filkollen i Inloggningsobjekt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS software updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS-programuppdateringar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "of junk found": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "skräp hittat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Threat found": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hot hittat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rebuilt automatically": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Byggs upp igen automatiskt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Left behind": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kvarlämnat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own files": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dina egna filer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps recreate these when they need them, so removing them is safe. They may come back over time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appar skapar dessa på nytt när de behöver dem, så de är säkra att ta bort. De kan komma tillbaka med tiden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Left over from apps, installs or devices that are gone or finished. They don't come back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rester från appar, installationer eller enheter som är borta eller klara. De kommer inte tillbaka."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are your own files. Check them before you remove anything; Filkollen never picks a kept copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Det här är dina egna filer. Kontrollera dem innan du tar bort något. Filkollen väljer aldrig en kopia som behålls."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking signatures…": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kontrollerar signaturer…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All apps look trustworthy": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alla appar ser pålitliga ut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked offline. \"Developer ID\" means signed by a registered developer with no notarization ticket attached; that's common and not a problem on its own. Unsigned or broken signatures deserve a closer look.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kontrollerat offline. ”Developer ID” betyder signerad av en registrerad utvecklare utan bifogad notariseringsbiljett. Det är vanligt och inget problem i sig. Osignerade eller trasiga signaturer förtjänar en närmare titt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld apps checked": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld appar kontrollerade"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld apps checked, %lld unsigned or broken": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld appar kontrollerade, %lld osignerade eller trasiga"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every file in the app was verified": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Varje fil i appen verifierades"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every file verified": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alla filer verifierade"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Team %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Team %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checks every file in the app against its signature. Slower for big apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kontrollerar varje fil i appen mot dess signatur. Långsammare för stora appar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show %@ in Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Visa %@ i Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld items": {
